{
  "title": "Kawa/Witch HUnt Turbo",
  "author": "Idan Gafni",
  "notes": "This profile is based on the Hendon turbo shot concept appropriate for the HU burrs and simulates a Bezzera Strega lever machine manually manipulated to increase EY. It imitates the technique I developed with my lever machine after years of lever manipulation iterations to satisfy my need for good espresso base for dry cappuccino. The gradual water filling combined with a blooming phase enables good saturation throughout the puck. Standard flow rates with this profile are usually 1.5-3.5 ml/s with most beans Strega in Italian translates to a witch so hopefully you get magical cups with this profile.",
